sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Caller
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant T as Tuple Space
    participant P as Fetcher Pool
    participant A as Analyzer Shards

    C->>O: crawl(seed_urls, max_pages, max_depth)
    O->>T: write seed URLs to url_queue

    loop BFS until max_pages or max_depth
        O->>P: checkout fetcher
        P-->>O: fetcher id
        O->>P: fetch(url)
        P-->>O: links + word counts
        O->>P: checkin fetcher
        O->>T: mark new links, enqueue (skip visited)
    end

    O->>A: analyze(results, interleaved across 2 shards)
    A-->>O: top words per shard
    O->>P: status_request to each process-group member
    P-->>O: fetch counts per worker
    O-->>C: pages crawled, top words, pages/sec
